  const ROESIE = '<h4 class="art-h">A unique perspective</h4><p><b>Life with limited vision isn’t easy. But one young woman never lets it stop her! Roesie Percy was born in Bristol, England, on 6th April 2001. Her parents, Dene and Angela Percy, were over the moon with their baby girl, but the doctors weren’t happy with Roesie’s eyes. ¹____ . Roesie was nearly blind.</b></p><p>Today, Roesie has got only a little vision. ²____</p><p>How does a girl with a visual impairment achieve this? The first reason is Roesie’s family. They love photography, and when Roesie was 11, one of her presents was a phone with a good camera. ³____</p><p>The second reason is her attitude. From her first day at school 15 years ago, Roesie was determined to succeed. ⁴____ People often look at details, but Roesie focuses on colour and light – and this gives her photos a unique perspective.</p><p>Last year was difficult for Roesie. ⁵____ . But today she is enjoying every moment. Her Instagram is filled with photos of New York from holidays in 2017 and 2018, her home city of Bristol, and photos of sport. You can find Roesie’s photos on her Instagram account: @a_blind_photographer. She has over 2,000 followers.</p>';
