  const SCI = '<p><b>1</b> Because of our growing population, we <b>are going to</b> need more accommodation fast. <mark>Imagine</mark> a home you can build with a 3D printer! Designers <mark>estimate</mark> the cost will be low, and they <b>will</b> soon create thousands of houses.</p>' +
    '<p><b>2</b> We grow our meat in laboratories. However, animal lovers shouldn’t <mark>worry</mark>: our products come from animal cells, but we don’t kill animals or use any cruel processes. Try our delicious meat. You’ll love it!</p>' +
    '<p><b>3</b> Purse? Money? Soon you will be able to pay with your hand! Our microchips are going to be at the Future Show on 14th August. We <mark>doubt</mark> you’ll find a better device!</p>' +
    '<p><b>4</b> Thanks to developments in space technology, scientists <mark>predict</mark> that holidays in space are going to become the new normal. While space travel is only affordable for the rich, we <b>believe</b> prices will come down soon.</p>' +
    '<p><b>5</b> A robot inside a pill will soon be an everyday medical treatment. As the robot can travel to parts of the body that surgeons can’t reach, scientists <mark>expect</mark> that it is going to replace operations.</p>';
